{"id":17,"titleZh":"巴黎之路","titleEn":"The Road to Paris","date":"1962-01-18","dateZh":"1962 年 1 月 18 日","concepts":"“巴黎口音”、全音阶挪用、跨文化复调性","thesis":"1900 年前后的巴黎像一面棱镜，美国爵士、希伯来圣咏与西班牙吉普赛音乐在那里吸纳了法式和声与透明配器，却依然保留各自本色。","plain":"二十世纪初德奥传统走向饱和，巴黎的新色彩吸引各国作曲家前往学习。格什温、布洛赫和法雅并非去模仿成法国人，而是借用巴黎的全音阶、复调碰撞与轻盈配器（如钢片琴、竖琴与擦钹），让自己原有的母语表达更有层次。","scenes":["伯恩斯坦在钢琴上拆解格什温《一个美国人在巴黎》：先按直白美式摇摆弹主题，再叠加高低双调性制造微醺法式风味，配以出租车喇叭的全音阶鸣笛、钢片琴与轻嘶钹声还原街头画面。","请出大提琴家扎拉·内尔索娃合演布洛赫《所罗门》，演法雅《三角帽》舞曲前专门拆开让弦乐拉 E 大调、铜管同时吹 F 大调，听清复调碰撞后再合奏。"],"category":"文化与跨界","bilibili":{"bvid":"BV1Ci4y1c7Tr","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ci4y1c7Tr","title":"掘火中译：伯恩斯坦《年轻人的音乐会》| 通往巴黎之路","duration":"54:29","uploader":"掘火档案（掘火中译）"},"scriptUrl":"https://leonardbernstein.com/lectures/television-scripts/young-peoples-concerts/road-to-paris","repertoire":[{"composer":"Gershwin","piece":"An American in Paris","titleZh":"一个美国人在巴黎","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview211/v4/7f/a3/bd/7fa3bd53-5e74-593a-1362-6e54b355c63f/mzaf_10903899735952442013.plus.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/an-american-in-paris/594512997?i=594513241&uo=4","recordingArtist":"Leonard Bernstein & New York Philharmonic","recordingTrack":"An American in Paris","youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Gershwin%20An%20American%20in%20Paris+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Gershwin%20An%20American%20in%20Paris"},{"composer":"Ernest Bloch","piece":"Schelomo (Rhapsodie Hébraïque)","titleZh":"所罗门（大提琴狂想曲）","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Ernest%20Bloch%20Schelomo+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Ernest%20Bloch%20Schelomo"},{"composer":"Manuel de Falla","piece":"Two Dances from The Three-Cornered Hat","titleZh":"三角帽双舞曲","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null